param=param_2153,npc_14517
param=param_2168,npc_14518
param=param_2123,37
param=param_2124,31
param=param_2097,1
param=param_2184,Like most trolls, Dad was named after his first attempt to eat his own father. Like a giant rock, there's not a great deal of intellect there, but some impressive might. You've been warned.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: Troll Stronghold<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: As well as bashing your brains in with melee combat, Dad has an attack that will hit through pretty much any defence, knocking you back a few paces.
param=param_2102,Smash the human!
