param=param_2184,Some remember the day when an evil chicken appeared, and actually took a while to kill, only to find it dropped a few feathers. Some even rolled their eyes at how easy one was to kill. Many think differently when faced with an army of them.<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: You must fight 15 evil chickens in a multi-way combat arena without the use of any prayers. The evil chicken attacks with magic, so you will be bombarded with hits.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quests required to play</col>: Recipe for Disaster.
