param=param_1271,"aif_omge_quest_icons_01,0"
param=param_1273,Obtain and use a ranged weapon.
param=param_1274,Click on the ranged equipment stand to get a shortbow and some arrows.
param=param_1275,Equip the shortbow and arrows in the same way you equipped the scimitar: open your inventory with the bag icon and click on the shortbow then the arrows.
param=param_1276,While wielding the shortbow and arrows, attack the training dummy.
