// 15368
[struct_15368]
param=param_3044,Introduction to Combat
param=param_3045,Learn the basics of combat in RuneScape.<br><br>Demonstration:<br>Kill a lowly skeleton.<br>Hover over the rank icons to see completion requirements.
param=param_3046,Kill the skeleton with few or no prompts from Lady Deathknell.
param=param_3047,Kill the skeleton without too many prompts from Lady Deathknell.
param=param_3048,Kill the skeleton.
param=param_3049,storablelabel_6

// 15369
[struct_15369]
param=param_3044,Combat Styles
param=param_3045,Learn how to attack with melee and ranged weapons and cast spells.<br><br>Demonstration:<br>Attack a training dummy with all three styles.<br>Hover over the rank icons to see completion requirements.
param=param_3046,Attack the training dummy, choosing the correct style all of the time.
param=param_3047,Attack the training dummy, choosing the correct style most of the time.
param=param_3048,Attack the training dummy, rarely or never choosing the correct style.
param=param_3049,storablelabel_3

// 15370
[struct_15370]
param=param_3044,The Combat Triangle
param=param_3045,Learn about the relationship between combat styles.<br><br>Demonstration:<br>From a selection of three skeletons, attack the skeleton that is weakest against a given weapon.<br>Hover over the rank icons to see completion requirements.
param=param_3046,Attack the weakest skeleton first time most of the time.
param=param_3047,Attack the weakest skeleton most of the time
param=param_3048,Attack the skeletons, rarely or never choosing the weakest skeleton.
param=param_3049,storablelabel_2

// 15371
[struct_15371]
param=param_3044,Targeting, Enemy Weaknesses and Damage Types
param=param_3045,Learn how to target an enemy before entering combat, inspect that enemy and find the enemies weakness' before attacking it. Expand on combat styles by explaining different attack styles available to each combat style.<br><br>Demonstration:<br>Attack a set of skeletons with the correct attack style.<br>Hover over the rank icons to see completion requirements.
param=param_3046,Attack the skeleton that is naturally weak to the weapon provided most of the time.
param=param_3047,Attack the skeleton that is naturally weak to the weapon provided some of the time.
param=param_3048,Attack a skeleton, rarely or never picking the skeleton that is naturally weak to the weapon provided.
param=param_3049,storablelabel_7

// 15372
[struct_15372]
param=param_3044,Using the Ability Bar and Basic Abilities
param=param_3045,Teaches you how to use the ability bar. Introduces abilities and ability based combat.<br><br>Demonstration:<br>Kill waves of skeletons using abilities.<br>Hover over the rank icons to see completion requirements.
param=param_3046,Kill all the skeletons while using multiple abilities from the action bar.
param=param_3047,Kill all the skeletons and use an ability.
param=param_3048,Kill all the skeletons.
param=param_3049,storablelabel_4

// 15373
[struct_15373]
param=param_3044,Adrenaline, Threshold Abilities and Ultimate Abilities
param=param_3045,Introduces the use of adrenaline and how to use more powerful abiltiies.<br><br>Demonstration:<br>Kill a skeletal juggernaut using powerful abilities.<br>Hover over the rank icons to see completion requirements.
param=param_3046,Kill the skeletal juggernaut and use a threshold and an ultimate ability.
param=param_3047,Kill the skeletal juggernaut and use a threshold or an ultimate ability.
param=param_3048,Kill the skeletal juggernaut.
param=param_3049,storablelabel_5

// 15374
[struct_15374]
param=param_3044,Ability Effects
param=param_3045,Learn how abilities can affect your opponent in more ways than just damage.<br><br>Demonstration:<br>Kill waves of skeletons.<br>Hover over the rank icons to see completion requirements.
param=param_3046,Kill all the skeletons using multiple ability effects.
param=param_3047,Kill all the skeletons using an ability effect.
param=param_3048,Kill all the skeletons.
param=param_3049,storablelabel_1

