param=param_3827,Drag an ability from the interface on the left into the action bar to add it to your action bar.

// 24418
[struct_24418]
param=param_3824,Powers: Prayer
param=param_3827,Drag a prayer from the interface on the left into the centre to view a description about what it does.

// 24419
[struct_24419]
param=param_3824,Powers: Prayer
param=param_3827,Drag a prayer from the interface on the left onto the action bar for quick access.

// 24420
[struct_24420]
param=param_3824,Social: Hiscores
param=param_3827,The Seasonal Hiscores show temporary, time-limited hiscore tables. Sometimes, additional rewards can be gained for being the top player when the competition ends.
