// 26535
[struct_26535]
param=param_3824,Treasure Hunter
param=param_3827, I've placed some of my enormous riches inside these chests, and I'm letting anyone who can bring me Treasure Hunter keys open them and keep the prizes inside!
param=param_3832,1

// 26536
[struct_26536]
param=param_3824,Treasure Hunter: Keys
param=param_3827,This shows how many keys you have. One key opens one chest, and the prize is yours to keep! I'll let you have one key per day for free, or two if you're a member. You can also buy keys directly, or earn them during your adventures!

// 26537
[struct_26537]
param=param_3824,Treasure Hunter: Prizes
param=param_3827,These gems contain the fantastic prizes in this game of Treasure Hunter! Each of the five chests behind me contains one of these prizes, guaranteed!

// 26538
[struct_26538]
param=param_3824,Treasure Hunter: Chests
param=param_3827,You can open one chest per game, and it will cost you one key to get the goodies waiting inside. To play, simply click a chest!<br>Good luck, and remember to come and see me every day if you want your free keys!
param=param_3832,1

// 26539
[struct_26539]
param=param_3824,Treasure Hunter: Hearts of Ice
param=param_3827,These magical crystals are Hearts of Ice. You can use these powerful artefacts to freeze categories. This will prevent you from winning prizes within that category! Visit the Categories screen for more information.<br>Hearts of Ice are obtained when purchasing Treasure Hunter keys directly, finding keys around the world and opening at least five chests per day.

