param=param_4256,5
param=param_4257,Prayer
param=param_4258,A foul creature is surfacing in Lumbridge Swamp. Ysondria needs help purifying the corruption to destroy the creature.<br><br>Train your Prayer skill at this social skilling hub.

// 28227
[struct_28227]
