param=param_4252,11
param=param_4254,1
param=param_4253,rs3_icon_path_minigame
param=param_4256,2
param=param_4257,Minigame
param=param_4258,Team up with fellow adventurers and battle an opposing team to collect the most sacred clay, the building blocks of creation.<br><br>Go to the Mystic's Camp in the Gamers' Grotto to find out more.

