param=param_2128,32
param=param_2097,2
param=param_2184,Yelps is back for another beating. He will use his wealth and sneaky cunning to protect himself in battle.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: The Mighty Fall<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: Yelps has the ability to perform his 'extra spin for the win' attack, which can inflict high damage. Unlike his previous version of this attack, this one will track you around the arena instead of randomly moving, so keep running!  He can also call on hired goons to help beat you up when it looks like things will go badly for him.  While they are active, he will take less damage.
param=param_2102,Extra spin for the win!
