param=param_2097,2
param=param_2184,As a manifestation of the elder god Jas, this enemy is a formidible opponent. Encountered in a twisted mindscape, she will do her best to destroy you.<br><br><col=F5B241>Quest</col>: One of a Kind<br><br><col=F5B241>Combat</col>: As a fragment of an elder god, Jas will attack with powerful magic.  She has access to magical spells and abilities like Asphixiate which will make fighting her tricky.  In addition she will summon 'false users,' who each have powerful abilities.
