// 30757
[struct_30757]
param=param_4911,Genie's Blessing II, July 2015
param=param_4910,Karima is back! Open chests this weekend to collect stars and lamps. When using them, you'll have a chance of getting a visit from Karima – the wish granting genie.<br><br>She'll offer you a variety of Blessings – you can ask her for gold, or Bonus XP in either a specific skill, or one at random which will grant you more Bonus XP! Keep rubbing lamps or wishing on your stars, because Karima has no limit, but hurry - when she appears she will only stick around for 4 minutes before disappearing. Genie's are busy you know!<br><br>
