// 31910
[struct_31910]
param=param_4911,Dragon Chests, July 2015
param=param_4910,Open chests in Treasure Hunter to have a chance at scoring a brand new Dragon Chest! Each chest comes in a different variety and will increase the amount of prizes within!<br><br>Adamant Chests will give you double the prize, Rune chests will triple your prize, and Dragon chests will quadruple any prize you get, including when you're using multiple keys! There aren't any limits to the amount of chests you can get your hands on – but they'll be gone once the promotion ends!<br><br>
