param=param_4738,2
param=param_4739,2
param=param_4911,Death Lotus Training, August 2015
param=param_4909,true
param=param_4910,The ultimate ninja training, take on the challenge of the Death Lotus to complete a variety of tasks and challenges. Once you have completed a row or column, you will be rewarded with outfit pieces, cash bags or experience. Complete the entire scroll and you will earn the ability to prestige, unlocking Death Lotus themed weapons and outfit recolours. Earn Shurikens from Treasure Hunter to instantly finish tasks, and be sure to be on the lookout for the Ninja Master roaming Gielinor.
param=param_4912,0
param=param_4913,true
param=param_4920,enum_10291
