param=param_4911,Harvest Festival, August 2015
param=param_4909,true
param=param_4910,It's time for a festival! Win Harvest Festival seeds on Treasure Hunter which can be planted anywhere and will quickly reach full growth. Once grown, pick the produce and offer it to the Gods for Prayer XP or return it to the earth for Farming XP.<br><br>You will also receive magic beans during the festival - one for every 200 Farming XP gained and they can be traded in to Martin the Master Gardener for various Farming seeds.
param=param_4912,1
