param=param_4858,Tier 70 hybrid armour created from tarddian crystal. Increases the amount of crystal shards and crystal fragments gathered on Tarddiad.<br><br>Set effect:-<br>(2) - Increases damage against crystal shapeshifters by 5%. Increases chance to activate the attuned crystal weapon's effect by 3%.<br>(3) - On hit have a chance to cause <col=ffcc00>Tarddian Fury</col> which deals <col=ffffff>Agility %</col> of basic weapon damage as AoE Damage around you.<br>(4) - <col=ffcc00>Tarddian Fury</col> will now free you from stuns and bleeds.
