param=param_4858,Tier 80 hybrid armour created from tarddian crystal. Increases the amount of crystal shards and crystal fragments gathered on Tarddiad.<br><br>Set effect:-<br>(2) - Increases damage against crystal shapeshifters by 10%. Increases chance to activate the attuned crystal weapon's effect by 6%.<br>(3) - On hit have a chance to cause <col=ffcc00>Tarddian Fury</col> which deals <col=ffffff>Agility %</col> of basic weapon damage as AoE Damage around you.<br>(4) - <col=ffcc00>Tarddian Fury</col> will now free you from stuns and bleeds.<br>(5) - Chance to cause <col=ffcc00>Harmonious Resonance</col> on hit or whilst using Seren spells. Whilst active <col=ffcc00>Harmonious Resonance</col> will reduce the prayer drain of Seren aligned curses to zero, increase the duration of crystalise and crystal mask and improve the effectiveness of aurora spells.
param=param_4862,1
param=param_4853,1

