// 32484
[struct_32484]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Pets
param=param_3827,Pets are designed to keep you company as you explore the game.<br><br>Some can be bought, while others are given as rewards for completing quests and other pieces of content.

// 32485
[struct_32485]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Pets
param=param_3827,Pets come in three varieties: <col=FFCB05>legendary</col>, <col=FFCB05>companion</col> and <col=FFCB05>follower</col>.<br><br>These buttons can be used to view the different types of pet. Any pets you own will be shown in the area to the right.

// 32486
[struct_32486]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Pets
param=param_3827,These buttons can be used to change your pets' appearance.

// 32487
[struct_32487]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Pets
param=param_3827,This button can be used to summon a pet, if you have one, and make it follow you.

// 32488
[struct_32488]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Pets
param=param_3827,Also, if you want to buy a pet you can do so here.

// 32489
[struct_32489]
param=param_3824,Hero: Loadout
param=param_3827,The Loadout tab can be used to view your items and equipment.

// 32490
[struct_32490]
param=param_3824,Hero: Loadout
param=param_3827,The contents of your backpack are shown here.

// 32491
[struct_32491]
param=param_3824,Hero: Loadout
param=param_3827,And your equipped items are shown here.

// 32492
[struct_32492]
param=param_3824,Hero: Loadout
param=param_3827,This area gives you a breakdown of your current combat effectiveness.

// 32493
[struct_32493]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Wardrobe
param=param_3827,This part of the interface shows all the different cosmetic items your character can wear.

// 32494
[struct_32494]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Wardrobe
param=param_3827,These buttons can be used to explore the different categories of item.<br><br>Any items you own will be shown in the area to the right.

// 32495
[struct_32495]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Wardrobe
param=param_3827,Clicking on an item will show you how the item will appear on your character.

// 32496
[struct_32496]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Wardrobe
param=param_3827,Clicking the <col=FFcb05>activate</col> button will apply the item to your character.<br><br>If you don't own the item this button will allow you to buy it.

// 32497
[struct_32497]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Wardrobe
param=param_3827,Remember, cosmetic items have no effect on your combat abilities!

// 32498
[struct_32498]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Titles
param=param_3827,Titles can be used to make your character's name more interesting.<br><br>Some can be bought, while others are given as rewards for completing quests and other pieces of content.

// 32499
[struct_32499]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Titles
param=param_3827,These buttons can be used to explore the different categories of title.<br><br>Any titles you have access to will be shown in the area to the right.

// 32500
[struct_32500]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Titles
param=param_3827,Clicking on a title will display it here, alongside your character's name.

// 32501
[struct_32501]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Titles
param=param_3827,Clicking the <col=FFcb05>activate</col> button will apply the title to your character.<br><br>If you don't have access to the title this button will allow you to buy it.

// 32502
[struct_32502]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Animations
param=param_3827,This part of the interface shows all the different animations you can apply to your character.

// 32503
[struct_32503]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Animations
param=param_3827,These buttons can be used to explore the different categories of animation.<br><br>Any animations you have access to will be shown in the area to the right.

// 32504
[struct_32504]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Animations
param=param_3827,Clicking on an animation will give you a preview of it here.

// 32505
[struct_32505]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Animations
param=param_3827,Clicking the <col=FFcb05>activate</col> button will apply the animation to your character.<br><br>If you don't have access to the animation this button will allow you to buy it.

// 32506
[struct_32506]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Appearance
param=param_3827,This part of the interface allows you to change the style and colour of your character's hair.

// 32507
[struct_32507]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Appearance
param=param_3827,These buttons can be used to explore the different types of hairstyle.<br><br>Any hairstyles you have access to will be shown in the area to the right.

// 32508
[struct_32508]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Appearance
param=param_3827,Clicking on a hairstyle will show you how it will appear on your character.

// 32509
[struct_32509]
param=param_3824,Customisations: Appearance
param=param_3827,Clicking the <col=FFcb05>activate</col> button will apply the hairstyle to your character.<br><br>If you don't have access to the hairstyle this button will allow you to buy it.

// 32510
[struct_32510]
param=param_3824,Hero: Presets
param=param_3827,The Preset tab allows you to save sets of items which you can quickly withdraw from your bank.

// 32511
[struct_32511]
param=param_3824,Hero: Presets
param=param_3827,'Currently equipped' shows what your character is currently wearing and what is in your backpack.

// 32512
[struct_32512]
param=param_3824,Hero: Presets
param=param_3827,To store what you have currently equipped as a preset, click the save button next to an available slot.

// 32513
[struct_32513]
param=param_3824,Hero: Presets
param=param_3827,Here you will see the backpack items stored in a preset or what you are currently carrying (depending on which is selected).

// 32514
[struct_32514]
param=param_3824,Hero: Presets
param=param_3827,Here you will see the worn items stored in a preset or what you are currently wearing (depending on which is selected).

// 32515
[struct_32515]
param=param_3824,Hero: Presets
param=param_3827,To equip a preset, click the withdraw button to load the items from your bank.

// 32516
[struct_32516]
param=param_3824,Hero: Presets
param=param_3827,Additional preset slots can also be rented or permanently unlocked.

